WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.220
It looks like some kind of generator.

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:06.970
Wh-What is this?

00:00:08.810 --> 00:00:12.530
What are you plotting?

00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:27.650
Bio-pattern matched.

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:37.090
Now, break through the access restrictions.

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:41.450
Master.

00:00:42.460 --> 00:00:46.280
In the garden bloom the Flowers of Kent.

00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:50.520
The symbol of Dienheim, 
which bears the fruit of knowledge.

00:00:59.030 --> 00:01:00.910
It's working properly.

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:04.880
It may have been abandoned, but it's 
still a high-density energy body.

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:07.490
There was no way we wouldn't use it.

00:01:07.490 --> 00:01:10.780
And her usefulness is at an end.

00:01:12.620 --> 00:01:15.050
Now we just destroy her mind...

00:01:18.940 --> 00:01:21.400
<i>Don't look any deeper into me!</i>

00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:24.590
What's wrong?!

00:01:24.590 --> 00:01:26.870
What did she...

00:01:32.730 --> 00:01:34.120
It's out of control!

00:01:34.120 --> 00:01:37.860
It can't contain the energy from the bracelet!

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:39.190
At this rate...

00:03:27.510 --> 00:03:30.930
<b>Episode 7
Cutting the Tangled Thread</b>

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:32.180
What's going on?

00:03:44.170 --> 00:03:47.350
The Château de Tiffauges is active?

00:03:47.350 --> 00:03:51.370
They used the abandoned Château as a hideout?

00:04:03.340 --> 00:04:04.830
I won't let you get away!

00:04:12.820 --> 00:04:14.650
She's running wild!

00:04:18.030 --> 00:04:20.060
Surprised?

00:04:20.060 --> 00:04:23.180
But I'm as surprised as you are.

00:04:27.330 --> 00:04:29.260
She got us, huh?

00:04:32.070 --> 00:04:34.750
I knew it... That sound...

00:04:35.400 --> 00:04:38.270
<i>HQ! Tell us what's going on!</i>

00:04:38.270 --> 00:04:42.110
We've detected an Aufwachen waveform
 identical to the one from several days ago!

00:04:42.110 --> 00:04:44.640
It appears to match the
 bracelet's boot-up signal.

00:04:45.390 --> 00:04:47.370
This is Shem-ha.

00:04:47.370 --> 00:04:50.970
The Anunnaki whose revival Adam foretold.

00:04:51.590 --> 00:04:55.820
<i>Tsubasa and the others are in 
the area and dealing with it.</i>

00:04:56.590 --> 00:04:59.860
<i>Ichaival, Airgetlám, head there, as well!</i>

00:05:09.010 --> 00:05:11.390
We're up against a powerful cannon.

00:05:11.390 --> 00:05:13.780
There's a limit to how close 
we can get in the helicopter!

00:05:14.300 --> 00:05:16.840
But getting this far...

00:05:16.840 --> 00:05:18.130
...is good enough!

00:05:20.780 --> 00:05:29.010
<i>Zeios Igalima raizen tron.</i>

00:06:07.340 --> 00:06:09.050
Death!

00:06:10.770 --> 00:06:17.190
<i>I'm firing off Happy + Go Lucky x Heavy bass!</i>

00:06:17.190 --> 00:06:23.200
<i>The girl who's so cute that
 she wants to eat meat, is here</i>

00:06:23.200 --> 00:06:26.530
<i>A scythe typhoon ripping and tearing</i>

00:06:26.530 --> 00:06:29.510
<i>Even though it makes me dizzy</i>

00:06:29.510 --> 00:06:35.590
<i>I'm always ready for a fight,
 always doing my best</i>

00:06:35.590 --> 00:06:41.340
<i>When our songs overlap 
for the final fight song</i>

00:06:41.340 --> 00:06:47.170
<i>we'll rip apart even the tallest 
wall and create the future</i>

00:06:47.170 --> 00:06:49.960
<i>Our dreams won't lose</i>

00:06:49.960 --> 00:06:53.960
<i>Push through it with your strong love</i>

00:06:51.730 --> 00:06:53.970
Shirabe-chan! Kirika-chan!

00:06:53.970 --> 00:06:56.440
We're more mobile than it is!

00:06:54.440 --> 00:06:55.340
<i>Ready go!</i>

00:06:55.340 --> 00:07:00.790
<i>I may be inexperienced and 
incomplete but I won't run away</i>

00:07:00.790 --> 00:07:07.660
<i>When I believed and overcame, 
my history became stars</i>

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:04.510
First we need to get some 
distance and do some recon!

00:07:04.510 --> 00:07:05.780
You can do that, can't you?

00:07:08.010 --> 00:07:08.600
Yeah!

00:07:08.600 --> 00:07:09.270
Death!

00:07:10.470 --> 00:07:14.810
<i>Now illuminate the dark 
with hope, light, and support</i>

00:07:14.810 --> 00:07:18.360
<i>See, someone's waiting for you</i>

00:07:18.360 --> 00:07:23.150
<i>Let's go together. Twin heart!</i>

00:07:22.820 --> 00:07:24.330
The Wielders have entered combat!

00:07:24.330 --> 00:07:25.300
But...

00:07:25.710 --> 00:07:30.080
They haven't been able to land an effective 
blow on the higher-dimensional being.

00:07:30.080 --> 00:07:31.120
Yeah...

00:07:31.130 --> 00:07:37.630
<i>Ready go! Together we can 
open up a wide world where</i>

00:07:37.630 --> 00:07:42.940
<i>we can laugh and cry with the
 comrades we sing with...</i>

00:07:37.760 --> 00:07:39.640
<b>Fatal Chains Star Money</b>

00:07:42.940 --> 00:07:45.710
<i>No matter what happens today...</i>

00:07:50.150 --> 00:07:51.070
Kiri-chan!

00:07:51.070 --> 00:07:53.800
As I thought, killing a god is...

00:08:01.280 --> 00:08:03.220
God-killing fist!

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:07.720
Hibiki-san!

00:08:12.890 --> 00:08:14.330
Energy convergence!

00:08:14.330 --> 00:08:16.160
Hibiki-chan is in danger!

00:08:18.640 --> 00:08:20.280
I can't lose...

00:08:20.780 --> 00:08:24.810
I need to find Miku... and one more time...

00:08:28.980 --> 00:08:30.780
One more time...

00:08:32.700 --> 00:08:33.720
I'm fine.

00:08:33.720 --> 00:08:36.900
I know. That's why you can't 
do anything crazy right now!

00:08:36.900 --> 00:08:38.010
Just fine...

00:08:38.910 --> 00:08:40.820
Hey, are you okay?

00:08:41.340 --> 00:08:46.050
If we lose Tachibana, our ace in the hole, 
that puts us at a massive disadvantage!

00:08:46.050 --> 00:08:49.550
We need to retreat and regroup!

00:08:49.550 --> 00:08:50.960
Can you stand?

00:08:50.960 --> 00:08:52.580
We're heading home.

00:09:07.520 --> 00:09:10.400
Vanessa. You're back?

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:12.230
Sorry, but we need to get to work.

00:09:12.230 --> 00:09:13.860
What's the situation?

00:09:13.860 --> 00:09:16.740
The divine power has begun to affix itself.

00:09:16.740 --> 00:09:19.640
But there was more mass than we expected,

00:09:19.640 --> 00:09:22.210
and we did an emergency 
purge outside the fortress.

00:09:22.210 --> 00:09:24.090
And this was the result.

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:28.000
So that's the result of moving too 
fast with no room for error...

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:31.450
They would've found this spot before too long.

00:09:32.020 --> 00:09:32.740
If anything,

00:09:32.740 --> 00:09:37.660
we're lucky that the manifestation of the 
god's power drove away the Symphogears.

00:09:38.470 --> 00:09:40.350
I hope you're right...

00:09:40.950 --> 00:09:42.920
If the final battle is close,

00:09:42.920 --> 00:09:46.940
I want to get rid of our little burden there.

00:09:48.390 --> 00:09:51.860
Hibiki-kun took more damage than it may appear.

00:09:52.350 --> 00:09:55.330
But thanks to Tsubasa's 
quick decision to withdraw,

00:09:55.330 --> 00:09:57.790
we were able to avoid the worst.

00:09:58.400 --> 00:10:01.730
No... Protecting the weak is my duty.

00:10:02.190 --> 00:10:04.980
Kanade would've done the same thing.

00:10:07.990 --> 00:10:13.460
Commander. I finished analyzing 
the data that Maria-san suggested.

00:10:13.460 --> 00:10:15.260
Analyzing data?

00:10:15.260 --> 00:10:17.430
What data?

00:10:17.430 --> 00:10:22.760
I recognized the dissonance I heard 
when the bracelet activated.

00:10:23.170 --> 00:10:26.330
We applied linguistic adjustment 
patterns to the sound

00:10:26.330 --> 00:10:28.540
to compensate for time 
degradation and EM distance

00:10:28.540 --> 00:10:30.900
and this was the predicted output.

00:10:30.900 --> 00:10:33.260
Linguistic adjustment patterns?

00:10:43.780 --> 00:10:45.320
This song...

00:10:45.320 --> 00:10:46.940
I've heard it somewhere...

00:10:47.530 --> 00:10:49.740
It was the one Maria used to sing.

00:10:50.190 --> 00:10:51.700
You know it?

00:10:52.100 --> 00:10:53.880
The song's name is "Apple."

00:10:54.460 --> 00:10:59.230
When my ancestors were driven from their home 
by a large-scale power plant accident,

00:10:59.230 --> 00:11:01.450
this nursery rhyme was the 
one thing they took with them.

00:11:02.900 --> 00:11:05.310
It's been altered,

00:11:05.310 --> 00:11:09.400
but we can assume that the 
original was Maria-san's song.

00:11:09.770 --> 00:11:12.280
A song hummed by the Anunnaki?

00:11:12.280 --> 00:11:14.660
And the song of Maria-san's ancestors?

00:11:15.820 --> 00:11:18.850
The resonance phenomenon seen 
during the Frontier incident...

00:11:19.830 --> 00:11:23.010
It would be easy to just 
dismiss it as a miracle.

00:11:23.010 --> 00:11:26.510
But if Maria-kun's song was the trigger,

00:11:26.510 --> 00:11:30.090
there may be some secret behind it.

00:11:32.300 --> 00:11:35.650
The enemy's true nature is 
still shrouded in mystery.

00:11:36.160 --> 00:11:38.640
But we have a way forward.

00:11:38.640 --> 00:11:41.540
Let's do what we can!

00:11:42.130 --> 00:11:47.000
Miku-kun and Elfnein-kun 
are probably there, as well.

00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:48.130
Roger!

00:11:48.130 --> 00:11:48.960
Death!

00:11:55.950 --> 00:12:00.520
So what if I was causing trouble for someone?

00:12:02.230 --> 00:12:05.020
It was just an example!

00:12:05.800 --> 00:12:09.520
But if that happened, 
I would want you to stop me.

00:12:10.320 --> 00:12:12.640
Why me?

00:12:15.370 --> 00:12:18.180
Because you can.

00:12:18.180 --> 00:12:22.470
With the fists I love, 
the gentlest fists in the world...

00:12:23.810 --> 00:12:26.660
I don't really understand.

00:12:28.210 --> 00:12:29.550
I'll be counting on you.

00:12:30.130 --> 00:12:35.970
Because you're the only one
 I can fully give myself to.

00:12:40.110 --> 00:12:41.060
Miku...

00:12:50.180 --> 00:12:53.200
I need to test my new right hand.

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:56.930
And once in a while, 
I need to act like a big sister.

00:12:58.200 --> 00:13:04.390
It's going to take a little more time before 
the power of a god becomes complete.

00:13:04.390 --> 00:13:08.670
Even the tiniest threat 
must be eliminated.

00:13:10.550 --> 00:13:11.580
She...

00:13:11.580 --> 00:13:13.390
...was awake?

00:13:17.610 --> 00:13:18.690
Oh, my.

00:13:18.690 --> 00:13:21.980
Now that your actions have 
become a threat to the world,

00:13:21.980 --> 00:13:24.210
isn't it painful to be alive?

00:13:26.170 --> 00:13:32.550
The old me would've been willing 
to disappear to save the world.

00:13:32.550 --> 00:13:37.050
But I borrowed this body
from someone I care about.

00:13:37.690 --> 00:13:40.490
I don't want to disappear!

00:13:40.490 --> 00:13:41.670
I see...

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:44.470
But I'm afraid you'll have to.

00:13:44.470 --> 00:13:45.880
What do I do?

00:13:46.530 --> 00:13:48.590
But I can't...

00:13:48.590 --> 00:13:50.800
Next time, I won't miss.

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:53.230
Somebody!

00:14:00.280 --> 00:14:02.020
Wh-What?

00:14:02.360 --> 00:14:04.110
Sword Breaker...

00:14:04.110 --> 00:14:07.270
If you believe its swing 
to be that of a blade...

00:14:10.730 --> 00:14:11.980
Twice in a day?!

00:14:13.350 --> 00:14:15.130
Hang in there!

00:14:19.270 --> 00:14:20.920
Take the initiative!

00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:22.420
And do it with a flash!

00:14:28.010 --> 00:14:32.770
I'm the strongest, and always 
the one to flip the table!

00:14:38.910 --> 00:14:40.800
You're...

00:14:40.800 --> 00:14:43.820
The discarded bodies 
chained to the reactor...

00:14:50.020 --> 00:14:52.580
Scrap? Spare bodies?

00:14:52.580 --> 00:14:54.700
There're lots of things you could call us.

00:14:54.700 --> 00:14:58.860
But now that you've reactivated 
us, we'll do all we can.

00:14:58.860 --> 00:15:01.410
You seem like Master, but you're not!

00:15:01.410 --> 00:15:03.750
You're a little like her, though!

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:08.090
And serving our master is our duty!

00:15:08.090 --> 00:15:13.990
They seemed intent on using the latent 
memories storied in our bodies as energy.

00:15:13.990 --> 00:15:15.680
But we won't let them.

00:15:16.130 --> 00:15:19.450
Now, Master, give us your orders.

00:15:19.450 --> 00:15:22.210
We can do this the boring way, and run,

00:15:22.210 --> 00:15:24.680
or the flashy way, and fight back!

00:15:24.680 --> 00:15:27.680
Then... there's something I want to do!

00:15:28.730 --> 00:15:32.330
Commander! Incoming communication 
from the outside on a dedicated line!

00:15:32.330 --> 00:15:34.540
A dedicated line?

00:15:34.540 --> 00:15:35.830
Can you put it on the monitor?

00:15:35.830 --> 00:15:36.670
Yes!

00:15:38.020 --> 00:15:40.250
<i>Sorry! It's me!</i>

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:41.940
Elfnein-kun!

00:15:42.330 --> 00:15:45.960
Now that I've sent this message, 
they may be able to track me,

00:15:45.960 --> 00:15:47.670
so I'll be quick!

00:15:47.670 --> 00:15:50.290
<i>I'm currently inside the 
Château de Tiffauges!</i>

00:15:50.290 --> 00:15:52.750
<i>Both Miku-san and I are here!</i>

00:15:52.750 --> 00:15:55.230
Miku-san is there, too?

00:15:57.560 --> 00:15:59.200
Of course!

00:15:59.200 --> 00:16:02.270
We believed that. That's why we
 were able to do those crazy things.

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:04.930
Us and that idiot, too!

00:16:05.390 --> 00:16:10.410
With the help of the Autoscorers, 
I'm going to try and save Miku-san.

00:16:10.410 --> 00:16:14.880
<i>The god isn't complete. There's still time!</i>

00:16:14.880 --> 00:16:16.080
You...?

00:16:16.080 --> 00:16:17.060
That's crazy!

00:16:17.060 --> 00:16:18.280
<i>Yes, it is!</i>

00:16:18.710 --> 00:16:21.620
<i>So... please send backup.</i>

00:16:22.670 --> 00:16:24.720
We're in the middle of enemy territory.

00:16:24.720 --> 00:16:27.300
If whatever I do puts me in danger,

00:16:27.300 --> 00:16:28.960
I have to fight!

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:37.680
We're wounded and our god-killer 
is out of the fight.

00:16:37.680 --> 00:16:40.070
<i>Hibiki-san is hurt?</i>

00:16:40.070 --> 00:16:43.390
Just hang in there until 
we can send reinforcements.

00:16:44.030 --> 00:16:45.230
I'm counting on you!

00:16:45.230 --> 00:16:46.130
<i>Right!</i>

00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:48.560
Master...

00:16:49.970 --> 00:16:51.690
A boring but deadly situation.

00:16:52.750 --> 00:16:55.850
This time, we can't catch them off-guard.

00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:00.500
Guys!

00:17:01.570 --> 00:17:03.390
We'll handle this...

00:17:03.840 --> 00:17:06.920
Garie, escort Master.

00:17:06.920 --> 00:17:08.280
Leave it to me.

00:17:08.280 --> 00:17:11.760
I've got the path to our 
destination right here.

00:17:17.230 --> 00:17:18.330
Elza!

00:17:18.640 --> 00:17:20.160
Mika, you go, too.

00:17:20.160 --> 00:17:23.730
With you here, neither Phara nor 
I have anything to worry about.

00:17:23.730 --> 00:17:27.440
I know it's my job to be the cheerful one!

00:17:27.920 --> 00:17:29.150
Master!

00:17:29.150 --> 00:17:30.560
Let's go, now!

00:17:32.040 --> 00:17:33.220
I'm sorry...

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:34.860
No!

00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:36.820
Thank you, Phara!

00:17:36.820 --> 00:17:37.820
Leiur!

00:17:39.270 --> 00:17:41.150
I won't let you go!

00:17:51.610 --> 00:17:53.950
Sorry, this is a dead-end.

00:17:53.950 --> 00:17:55.990
You'll have to find something 
else to do with your time.

00:17:55.990 --> 00:17:59.000
Yeah, you're not going anywhere.

00:18:02.740 --> 00:18:06.850
Leiur and Phara will be fine, right?

00:18:09.400 --> 00:18:14.070
It's hard to say, but they'll do their best.

00:18:14.070 --> 00:18:18.160
So do your best to believe in them, okay?

00:18:26.360 --> 00:18:27.420
I kept you waiting, huh?

00:18:28.530 --> 00:18:30.010
Time for your punishment!

00:18:30.010 --> 00:18:31.290
No way!

00:18:35.000 --> 00:18:37.970
Jeez. What a mess.

00:18:43.630 --> 00:18:45.020
I won't let you!

00:18:49.160 --> 00:18:50.590
Y-You...

00:18:50.590 --> 00:18:52.230
Take care of Master!

00:18:52.640 --> 00:18:56.710
I wish I could have a 
fun mission like that...

00:18:56.710 --> 00:19:01.440
But with hands like these 
I can't hold her hands...

00:19:01.440 --> 00:19:02.950
I'm sad.

00:19:03.320 --> 00:19:04.440
Micha...

00:19:04.440 --> 00:19:08.550
Got it. I'll do my best for you, too!

00:19:09.480 --> 00:19:10.620
Micha!

00:19:15.300 --> 00:19:20.260
But your hands are really 
cool, Micha! I love them!

00:19:27.500 --> 00:19:29.090
She gave me a compliment!

00:19:29.090 --> 00:19:30.510
I'm blushing!

00:19:31.240 --> 00:19:33.800
You can't beat me with that scrapheap body...

00:19:33.800 --> 00:19:38.180
I'll just have to beat you up
 to hide my blushing!

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:52.990
Over there!

00:19:52.990 --> 00:19:55.290
Miku-san lies beyond that!

00:19:56.700 --> 00:19:58.210
What?

00:20:01.290 --> 00:20:02.690
Garie!

00:20:03.050 --> 00:20:05.130
We finally caught up...

00:20:12.280 --> 00:20:13.550
Garie!

00:20:14.710 --> 00:20:16.820
You tried to protect me?

00:20:18.150 --> 00:20:20.620
Aww, Master.

00:20:20.620 --> 00:20:22.880
I'm a very bad girl.

00:20:22.880 --> 00:20:25.790
I'd never do that.

00:20:25.790 --> 00:20:27.140
But...

00:20:27.530 --> 00:20:30.140
Stand taller.

00:20:30.140 --> 00:20:34.820
Our master always did!

00:20:35.470 --> 00:20:37.040
Carol was...

00:20:39.360 --> 00:20:42.700
She's too much of a handful, 
so I used my foot instead.

00:20:44.480 --> 00:20:47.150
Garie... Guys...

00:20:47.670 --> 00:20:49.830
You made this way too hard.

00:20:50.650 --> 00:20:52.850
They did all this for me...

00:20:52.850 --> 00:20:55.670
But that ends here.

00:20:56.390 --> 00:20:59.790
Then what can I do for everyone?

00:21:00.150 --> 00:21:01.860
There's nothing left...

00:21:03.630 --> 00:21:05.240
...that you can do!

00:21:07.120 --> 00:21:09.160
For everyone's sake, I will...

00:21:15.190 --> 00:21:16.410
What the hell?

00:21:48.170 --> 00:21:50.660
That's it, Master...

00:21:50.660 --> 00:21:53.150
That's what we wanted...

00:21:54.670 --> 00:21:57.560
Another impossible miracle 
at the last second?

00:21:57.910 --> 00:21:59.330
A miracle, you say?

00:22:01.040 --> 00:22:02.460
Not at all.

00:22:02.460 --> 00:22:05.040
I am the murderer of miracles!
